sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as IDE / desktop client
    participant Server as codex app-server
    participant Threads as Thread processor
    participant Core as codex-core session

    Client->>Server: initialize(client metadata)
    Server-->>Client: initialize result / notifications
    Client->>Server: initialized notification
    Client->>Server: thread/start or thread/resume
    Server->>Threads: create or load thread
    Threads->>Core: spawn or reconstruct session
    Core-->>Server: thread events
    Server-->>Client: thread/started
    Client->>Server: turn/start(threadId, input, overrides)
    Server->>Core: submit user turn
    Core-->>Server: item and turn events
    Server-->>Client: item/started, deltas, item/completed
    opt operation needs permission
        Core-->>Server: approval request
        Server->>Client: JSON-RPC server request
        Client-->>Server: allow or deny response
        Server-->>Core: approval decision
    end
    Core-->>Server: turn/completed
    Server-->>Client: turn/completed notification
